R-C13 R-C11 R-TF4 R-EC19 R-C12 (slice 081): `install` with a bad value of `min-release-age-exclude` in the `[resolution]` table of `talon.toml`. The check runs when the file is read, before any release list, so there is no `list_dirs` of the index, no `http_get` and no write.
Run 1: the pattern `acme/*/x` is not `owner/repo` or `owner/*`: exit 19, `<file>:2: resolution.min-release-age-exclude: 'acme/*/x' must be owner/repo or owner/*`. Run 2: the value is a text and not a list: exit 19, `...: must be a list of owner/repo or owner/* patterns`, on the line of the key (line 3, after `min-release-age`). The home has no `config.toml`.
